 shall consist of a number of no fewer than five members. It shall have a secretary from among the Center’s employees. The decision to form the committee shall determine the chairman and his deputy, as well as its term","language":"en","languageLabel":"الإنجليزية"}],"imageGallery":[]}],"wordForms":[],"search":"لجنة الاعتماد المدرسي  School Accreditation Committee  It is a committee formed by a decision of the President of the Commission. Its members shall be representatives from outside the Center. It shall be responsible for making the final decision regarding the accreditation of private and international schools. It shall consist of a number of no fewer than five members. It shall have a secretary from among the Center’s employees. The decision to form the committee shall determine the chairman and his deputy, as well as its term","nonDiacriticsLemma":"لجنة الاعتماد المدرسي","metaData":{"periodDateFrom":null,"periodDateTo":null},"lammaDetails":[{"form":"لجنة الاعتماد المدرسي"}],"autoGeneratedRoot":null,"entryRelations":[],"dynamicProps":[]}}
